ogation\n\nknows how the gateway to Gotham works"},{"id":"n1c855d2a9e","itemId":"i8db6bfbe36","team":"GM","by":"GM","at":1793454116292,"text":"Known for helping the Judges with gadgets\n\nhas a gate room to another dimension called Gotham"},{"id":"n6b1f027fa3","itemId":"i9894dfde6c","team":"GM","by":"GM","at":1793454183897,"text":"Access to Gotham and Gotham 2 (destroyed)"},{"id":"nf3dd385546","itemId":"ia30d06ce6c","team":"GM","by":"GM","at":1793454273077,"text":"Parallel dimension"},{"id":"n498116ea42","itemId":"i8d1a759ecb","team":"GM","by":"GM","at":1793454747277,"text":"Trying to get home to his home world in the dimension of Gotham. But failing because of other dimensional portals being open at the same time throwing off his calculations"},{"id":"n044f397128","itemId":"i8d1a759ecb","team":"GM","by":"GM","at":1793455040796,"text":"Pretended to be JCN to throw off the Judges and caused the ROBOT WARS to hide power surges and electrical equipment thefts"},{"id":"ne0fb4d41b7","itemId":"i4de532231f","team":"GM","by":"GM","at":1793467643034,"text":"The manufacturing plant for the AZMOV chipset"},{"id":"ncbb375ccad","itemId":"i9b1bf7b593","team":"GM","by":"GM","at":1793467694393,"text":"Framed for the Joker Toxin"},{"id":"nc0bdd0d325","itemId":"i19636d78f8","team":"GM","by":"GM","at":1793467822386,"text":"Toxin can't be made 100% in Gotham or Mega-City 1"},{"id":"ne87cdb8980","itemId":"i656d60cd96","team":"GM","by":"GM","at":1793468033579,"text":"Gotham's Riddler, Has saved Batman.\nHas been kidnapped and beaten by Riddler from Gotham 2.\nEscaped and seems to be helping Judges to Capture Riddler 2 and stop universal disaster"},{"id":"n972d11c608","itemId":"i83f366712c","team":"GM","by":"GM","at":1793468248654,"text":"Place where Toker Joxin was transferred to large Medical vehicle HAMMU-00"},{"id":"n9ae5906ce9","itemId":"i9e835b83f3","team":"GM","by":"GM","at":1793468789032,"text":"Prototype vehicle made after the initial success of the Automated mini medbot"},{"id":"n058836f34a","itemId":"icfb9a42265","team":"GM","by":"GM","at":1793469581471,"text":"Lando has dumped all his money in the HAMMU. It's unsanctioned by the justice dept of S21. Obviously trying to stay ahead of the competition."},{"id":"n7094894590","itemId":"icfb9a42265","team":"GM","by":"GM","at":1793469645910,"text":"Had been beaten by Riddler 2 from Gotham 2. Gold team saved his life"},{"id":"n95c380aad4","itemId":"i59b535c64d","team":"GM","by":"GM","at":1793469743342,"text":"Distributed Toker Joxin through city"},{"id":"n0ecb58ea92","itemId":"i59b05ff855","team":"GM","by":"GM","at":1793469902651,"text":"Infected with the Toker Joxin"},{"id":"n2cde433887","itemId":"i68e446944a","team":"GM","by":"GM","at":1793475032846,"text":"Brainiac has been hiding out on a floor in a sealed off area in Applied Robotics lab, only way in or out is with a portal"},{"id":"n92cc435319","itemId":"i60721b1737","team":"GM","by":"GM","at":1793475244019,"text":"Institute for criminally insane in Gotham"},{"id":"n772444fc0c","itemId":"i23ed501fd0","team":"GM","by":"GM","at":1793475483717,"text":"Site of attempted demolition triggering the HAMU-00"},{"id":"ndb4bc9337c","itemId":"icf871dc474","team":"GM","by":"GM","at":1793475534214,"text":"Machine designed to demolish large areas"},{"id":"n15c5ac4aac","itemId":"icf871dc474","team":"GM","by":"GM","at":1793475575884,"text":"Green team helped stop the plot to take the Demolished to Simpson Block and explode it"},{"id":"n3bc829d048","itemId":"ic0dcd92425","team":"GM","by":"GM","at":1793475735773,"text":"Kidnapped from Crock Block"},{"id":"n9db82851c8","itemId":"ic93bfdec73","team":"GM","by":"GM","at":1793475766254,"text":"Kidnapped boy for Cornelius"},{"id":"n61814f8b29","itemId":"i8a2a72ea30","team":"GM","by":"GM","at":1793475813004,"text":"Home of Willis' who's grandson was kidnapped"},{"id":"n6e66e2111a","itemId":"i46552df592","team":"GM","by":"GM","at":1793475905981,"text":"Mind powers \n\nKilled by Gold team in Plaza while rescuing Melvin Willis"},{"id":"n996a042c34","itemId":"i348029b841","team":"GM","by":"GM","at":1793476052691,"text":"Killed by Gold Team (Kee)\n\nWas attempting to set up a floor in Dallas Towers to hide out in\n\nComes from Gotham 2\n\nconvicted multiple murders and kidnapping of Riddler from Gotham"},{"id":"naab3efb211","itemId":"i348029b841","team":"GM","by":"GM","at":1793476152588,"text":"Was behind attempted explosion of Simpson Block and the plan to release Toker Joxin to the left over inhabitants\n\nComes from a Gotham 2 world where time is inverted"},{"id":"n9332ecffb9","itemId":"i2a0ff9d104","team":"GM","by":"GM","at":1793476268428,"text":"Has it's own food supplies and energy\n\nRiddler 2 was trying to convert a floor into a sanctum for himself and his followers"},{"id":"ne8dce628f9","itemId":"i29b03992f2","team":"GM","by":"GM","at":1793476434539,"text":"Site of elaborate clue from Joker to Judges"},{"id":"na5ecf0651b","itemId":"ie3f3f7c5e9","team":"GM","by":"GM","at":1793478082621,"text":"From a different dimension - trying to get back to it"},{"id":"ndaf53ce792","itemId":"ie3f3f7c5e9","team":"GM","by":"GM","at":1793478114665,"text":"Created the Robot War as a solution to hiding his Stealing of equipment and Power surges"},{"id":"nbab4410116","itemId":"iac3980e5e3","team":"GM","by":"GM","at":1793478824553,"text":"Expert in dimension travel and temporal displacement"},{"id":"n9ded76e436","itemId":"iac3980e5e3","team":"GM","by":"GM","at":1793478912751,"text":"Communicated with Riddler 2 and inadvertently gave him the plan to convert Dallas Towers floor into a home"},{"id":"n2cb91e4858","itemId":"ib81909a5da","team":"GM","by":"GM","at":1793482727574,"text":"First alias of Brainiac"},{"id":"n7605de238e","itemId":"i5864e7e2f9","team":"GM","by":"GM","at":1793482799144,"text":"secondary alias of Brainiac before he started the Robot War to hide his tracks"},{"id":"n6cad59440e","itemId":"i9e5bd5b239","team":"GM","by":"GM","at":1793484305020,"text":"Brainiac alter ego while carrying out the Robot Wars"}],"events":[],"obsFocus":{"seq":2,"kind":"team","id":"t760a457a70","label":"Green Judge Team","at":1793442779931}}